		Paragraph: A color is written in hexadecimal: `#RGB` or `#RRGGBB`. One more digit, or one more pair, is the opacity: `#RGBA` or `#RRGGBBAA`, from `0` or `00` (transparent) to `F` or `FF` (opaque).
